message: If you use these materials, please cite them as below.
title: "Interactive Hydraulic Bottle Jack Cross Section and Laboratory Materials"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based, offline-capable simulation of a hydraulic bottle jack in
  cross section, in which the animation is driven by hydraulic state rather
  than the reverse, together with a student laboratory handout and an
  instructor answer sheet for a disassembly and measurement activity on
  drained jacks. Includes a verification suite covering volume conservation,
  check valve logic, parametric drawing geometry, and interface behaviour.
type: software
